runs/35889147390\n- full release validation: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/35887899327\n- plugin npm publish: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/35934155492\n- plugin ClawHub submission: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/35934164174; public artifact verification follows successful release-parent completion\n- plugin ClawHub bootstrap: dispatched separately, not awaited by this proof: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/35934171495\n- OpenClaw npm publish: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/35930626357/attempts/1\n- Stable soak waived by operator: \"Operator-approved by Peter for 2026.9.6: soak-only live/E2E lanes not run (release_profile=beta, run_release_soak=false per 2026.9.5 precedent); 2026.9.5 to 2026.9.6 update proven via the upgrade-survivor and published-upgrade-survivor lanes, install smoke, and the first-hop compat lane.\"\n- Operator lane waiver: \"2026.9.6 Operator lane waiver approved by Peter (2026-09-23, \\\"release this now\\\"): non-proof CI, plugin and release-check lane failures are advisory for the 2026.9.6 stable; artifacts, install smoke, upgrade survivors and pack budget stay required.\"; waived lanes: normalCi checks-node-agentic-control-plane-agent-chat (failure); normalCi checks-node-bundle-infra-small-runtime-2 (failure); normalCi openclaw/ci-gate (failure)\n- npm Telegram beta E2E: not supplied\n- Android APK: skipped — apps/android/version.json is 2026.8.2, release train is 2026.9.6; run the shared mobile cutter (scripts/mobile-release-version.ts --prepare) before the next tag.\n\n",
